# Software industry mapping for PRM
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/prm/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:marketplace_partner owl:equivalentClass sw:MarketplacePartner .
legacy:marketplace_partner_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:marketplacePartnerId .
legacy:integration_agreement owl:equivalentClass sw:IntegrationAgreement .
legacy:integration_agreement_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:integrationAgreementId .
legacy:governs_marketplace_partner rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:governsMarketplacePartner .
